**Severity:** Medium

**Affected Code Location:** `signDoc` function (line 180-200)

**Description of the Issue:** The `signDoc` function updates the state without ensuring that the document exists before updating it. This can lead to phantom reads if another transaction creates the document after the initial check but before the update.

**Recommended Fix:** Ensure that the document exists before updating it.

